  "label": "ISIS Attack on Paris, November 13, 2015",
  "description": "A coordinated terrorist attack by ISIS militants in Paris, France, on November 13, 2015, which resulted in the deaths of 129 people (including 89 victims in the Bataclan concert hall) and injured hundreds more. The attack was carried out by multiple assailants targeting popular cultural venues and a restaurant. The event is widely recognized as one of the deadliest terrorist attacks in French history and had a profound global impact, triggering international outrage and security measures. The meme references this specific event to evoke trauma and justify political rhetoric.",
